{"unit_id": "ahhTou__dsh-live-proxy#feature-1", "repo": "ahhTou/dsh-live-proxy", "commit": "13dcda1e2c0b48cef7c0d487dea8510a20b3477c", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Live Proxy 的功能「mode」：运行时切换代理策略：用户在设置表单选择直连或手动 HTTP(S) 代理并保存，Host 即时重新应用策略。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:278", "lib/session.js:116"]}
