{"unit_id": "ahhTou__dsh-live-proxy#feature-3", "repo": "ahhTou/dsh-live-proxy", "commit": "13dcda1e2c0b48cef7c0d487dea8510a20b3477c", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Live Proxy 的功能「settings」：代理配置界面：设置页和插件配置入口共享表单，可编辑模式、代理地址、直连例外及探测周期和超时。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:343", "lib/client.js:466"]}
