{"unit_id": "ahhTou__dsh-live-proxy#caveat-1", "repo": "ahhTou/dsh-live-proxy", "commit": "13dcda1e2c0b48cef7c0d487dea8510a20b3477c", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Live Proxy 只通过 TCP 连接检查代理端口是否监听，不验证代理的上游网络；代理进程在线但无法联网时不会触发直连回落。（见 lib/probe.js:4-10）", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/probe.js:4-10"]}
